invariant: INV-16
file: p256_sign.c
catches: widemul_runtime_test
reason: the inverse of the signing nonce runs under CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED
  whatever answer the signature was handed. The signature is the same.
  bin/widemul_runtime_test requires p256_sign to call the native copies
  alone under the constant-time answer.

--- old
    widemul_p256_scalar_inverse(widemul, &k_inverse, k);
--- new
    widemul_p256_scalar_inverse(CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, &k_inverse, k);
